Explicitly explain:

- Which collection is the source of truth during each phase.
- Whether writes are allowed in legacy and target collections.
- How new records are synchronized.
- How updates and deletions are reconciled.
- What happens if cutover fails.
- What data must never be deleted during rollback.

Remove unsupported claims such as guaranteed rollback in under 60 seconds.

